      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present a case of acute abdomen due to a jejunal perforation. The final diagnosis was concluded a multiple endocrine neoplasia type I. In the literature reviewed, no similar clinical presentation was found. We review the diagnostic sequence and the management of these patients."},
